### Login
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "testing124"
}

### Get Profile
# @name profile
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Update User By ID
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/units/{{$dotenv TESTING_UNIT_ID}}/users/{{profile.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
  "givenName": "UpdatedFirstName",
  "surname": "UpdatedLastName"
}